  "5-amino-1mq": { mechanism: "A small-molecule inhibitor of NNMT (nicotinamide N-methyltransferase); blocks NNMT's depletion of SAM and nicotinamide in fat tissue, shifting cellular metabolism toward fat oxidation and preserving NAD+ salvage.", researchedFor: "Studied for obesity, metabolic dysfunction, and age-related muscle function via support of the NAD+ pathway.", researchStatus: "Preclinical / animal research; reversed obesity and improved glucose tolerance in diet-induced obese mice, but no published human efficacy or safety data exist.", knownAs: "", caveat: "No human trials have been published, so safety and an effective dose in people are unknown." },
